@title Heat legend: the preview note comes first, and the heat map's labels and legend follow the light theme
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The Temperature legend now opens with "Preview, not a solver result" while the map is the part-loss preview, so scrolling the legend never hides it. The heat view's own colours (legend text, device labels, borders, the airflow lines) come from the theme palette, so the Light theme reads properly instead of keeping dark-theme colours. The pictures are the evidence (drawn text).
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
key shift+h
wait 60
expect "Preview, not a solver result"
shot heat-dark
check_layout
check_blank heat-dark
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 20
shot heat-light
check_layout
check_blank heat-light
